      "id": "method",
      "class": "chapter chapter-light",
      "text": "P02 · 01 / THE METHOD What is Zi Wei Dou Shu? Birth information is used to construct a chart, interpreted through palaces, stars and timing themes. Rather than memorizing symbols, first see how a chart organizes the information. \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n One chart · Three layers How does one chart reveal many themes? Begin with the structure, then explore how palaces and stars relate to each other. Palaces Different areas of life Stars Patterns and relationships Timing Phases and change A visual introduction to chart reading 01 Birth details Confirm date, time and relevant inputs 02 Chart setup Generate the chart using declared rules 03 Twelve palaces Understand its thematic positions 04 Star patterns Read stars within their palace context 05 Timing Explore the periods the method supports Four approachable ways into one chart ✧ Overall pattern Start with the whole. ◇ Palace themes Find the topic you want to read. ✦ Star relationships Interpret symbols in their positions. ◷ Timing themes Explore change through periods. ",
